    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "checklist",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 186,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 168,
      "text": "on every delegated task, daemon-side:\n1 verify binding: pairing, expiry, nonce\n  (replay cache) - reject unknowns (S2)\n2 grant_refs exist + belong to this session (S2)\n3 every path through ONE containment resolver:\n  realpath, symlink-escape rejected (S1)\n4 fixed file-tool vocabulary on the chat path (S3)\n  local_command stays executor-face, consent-gated\n5 egress cap; every read AND every denial\n  ledgered, append-only (S5, S6)",
      "originalText": "on every delegated task, daemon-side:\n1 verify binding: pairing, expiry, nonce\n  (replay cache) - reject unknowns (S2)\n2 grant_refs exist + belong to this session (S2)\n3 every path through ONE containment resolver:\n  realpath, symlink-escape rejected (S1)\n4 fixed file-tool vocabulary on the chat path (S3)\n  local_command stays executor-face, consent-gated\n5 egress cap; every read AND every denial\n  ledgered, append-only (S5, S6)",
      "fontSize": 10.5,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
