      "text": "S6 audit join: the correlation id flows chokepoint -> delegation -> daemon ledger, joining local rows with hosted audit metadata (ch17.6).\npayload-capture assertions run against the fake daemon: planted synthetic values appear tokenized in EVERY captured outbound Anthropic request.",
